# Bazel
/bazel-*

# The bzlmod lock is left out for the same reason the one under build/ is, and
# with the same cost: the transitive module graph is whatever BCR serves at
# fetch time on each machine. Everything with a checksum of its own still has
# one, which is every Maven artifact, both lint jars, the GraalVM archive and
# every sysroot package.
# See https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/20369
MODULE.bazel.lock
/.bazelrc.user
/.bazel_downloader.cfg.user
